<Lang><T>Int</T><D>1</D></Lang></Item>
<Item XName="Font" Type="Font">
<Name>Courier New</Name>
<Size><T>Double</T><D>125</D></Size></Item>
<Item XName="FunctionBlock" Type="FunctionBlock" />
<Item XName="Page" Type="PageMgr">
<Item XName="Display0" Type="EquationDisp">
<DVport><T>Array_Dbl64</T><D>1;4;;;I124;eh14</D></DVport>
<PVPort><T>Array_Dbl64</T><D>1;4;;;fzbsNQC}z24;Yl9{cuzzd24</D></PVPort>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<ShowCmd><T>Int</T><D>1</D></ShowCmd>
<Split><T>Double</T><D>0.3</D></Split>
<Split2><T>Double</T><D>0.3</D></Split2>
<Window><T>Array_I64</T><D>1;4;;;3A;N4</D></Window>
<ZOrder><T>Int</T><D>2</D></ZOrder></Item></Item>
<Item XName="VarBlock" Type="VarBlock" /></Item>
<Item XName="Notes1" UserName="Notes1" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;NR DL BeamAcquisition&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example&amp;nbsp;Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;This example builds an end-to-end simulation for 3GPP NR downlink beam acquisition based on SS/PBCH blocks in FR2. In this example, users may explore different phased array structure in both transmitter and receiver side and check beam acquisition performance. Also, one simple LOS channel is provided based on DF phased array models with the support of user-defined AoD/AoA and antenna element patterns. Users can replace this simple model with complicated 5G MIMO channel for more accurate simulation.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Overall the followings are the features supported in the example.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;SS/PBCH signal generation &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Tx RF channel modeling and Tx phased array structure&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Tx Beam sweeping setting for SS/PBCH blocks&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;4.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;LOS MIMO channel with custom antenna pattern input (may also support 5G MIMO channel)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;5.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Thermal noise&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;6.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Rx RF channel modeling and Rx phased array structure&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;7.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Rx Beam sweeping setting for SS/PBCH blocks&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;8.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Synchronization and Beam Measurement&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;The followings are the results after simulation:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Transmit waveform and receiver waveform (see&lt;STRONG&gt; TxRxWaveform&lt;/STRONG&gt; Graph)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Measured power for each SS/PBCH block (see &lt;STRONG&gt;SSB_Power&lt;/STRONG&gt; Graph)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Synchronization information (see &lt;STRONG&gt;SyncInfo&lt;/STRONG&gt; Table)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;4.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;The measured angle with maximum power in Tx/Rx beams (see &lt;STRONG&gt;MaxTxRxBeam&lt;/STRONG&gt; Table)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Note that&lt;/STRONG&gt; for this release only FR2 Numerology 3&amp;nbsp;120KHz is supported. FR2 Numerology&amp;nbsp;4&amp;nbsp;240K is not supported in SS/PBCH signal generation.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Note that&lt;/STRONG&gt; in &lt;STRONG&gt;SSB_Power&lt;/STRONG&gt; Graph, it shows the power for each SS/PBCH block with the length &lt;STRONG&gt;SSB_Lmax_Len*NumRxBeams&lt;/STRONG&gt;, where &lt;STRONG&gt;SSB_Lmax_Len&lt;/STRONG&gt; is equal to 64 which is the number of SS/PBCH blocks in one SS/PBCH Periodicity, and &lt;STRONG&gt;NumRxBeams&lt;/STRONG&gt; is the number of sweeping beams in the receiver got from &lt;STRONG&gt;RxPhiTable&lt;/STRONG&gt; variable.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;The input parameters are all in &lt;STRONG&gt;GlobalParameters&lt;/STRONG&gt; equation where users can set parameters for NR SS/PBCH, RF and beams, Tx/Rx antenna arrays, channel, SNR etc.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;The details for each part are described as below.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;3GPP NR SS/PBCH Signal Generation&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;In this part, NR SS/PBCH for FR2 (Numerology 3 (120KHz)) is generated. There are several parameters defined in &lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;GlobalParameters equation for&lt;/SPAN&gt; SS/PBCH signal generation:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 21pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Numerology = 3; %3-&amp;gt; 120KHz, 4-&amp;gt; 240KHz&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 21pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;SSB_RBOffset = 10; %offset RB index in Carrier bandwidth&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 21pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;SSB_Lmax = 2; %L = 64&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 21pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;SSB_Periodicity = 0; %5ms, 10ms, 20ms, 40ms, 80ms, 160ms&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Tx Beam Sweeping for SS/PBCH Blocks&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;In this part, BeamformerWeights model is used to generate the weights for the beam of each SS/PBCH block. Note that by default, we allocate different SS/PBCH block into different azimuth angle (Phi), and the theta angle is fixed. The beam sweeping in azimuth angles is defined TxPhiTable variable in GlobalParameters equation which should contain at least 64 angles. Here users can add additional impairments to RF and Phased array, such as windowing, gain compression, phase shifter quantization and errors, etc.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;LOS channel with AoD/AoA&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;In this part, AntennaArrayTx model is used to generate the signal from transmit antenna array at given AoD direction, and then a certain delay is added. Finally, AntennaArrayRx is used to reproduce the signals at receiver antenna array with given AoA direction. Note that in both AntennaArrayTx and AntennaArrayRx models, custom antenna patterns can be imported to evaluate the performance of antenna array.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Noise&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-ascii-font-family: DengXian; mso-hansi-font-family: DengXian&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;In this part, the thermal noise is added onto each receiver antenna element with input&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi&apos;&gt;SNR&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt; variable in&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi&apos;&gt;GlobalParameters&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt; equation. Note that&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi&apos;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;SNR &lt;/STRONG&gt;variable &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;does not&amp;nbsp;take transmit beamforming gain into account. So,&amp;nbsp;the actual&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi&apos;&gt;SNR&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt; may be larger if there is a big&amp;nbsp;transmit beamforming gain.&amp;nbsp;However, for receiver beamforming gain, it has no effect on&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-FAMILY: DengXian; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi&apos;&gt;SNR&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt; as the noise is added onto receiver antenna element.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Rx Beam Sweeping for SS/PBCH Blocks&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;This part is&amp;nbsp;like Tx beam sweeping. Users may define different receiver beams in &lt;STRONG&gt;RxPhiTable&lt;/STRONG&gt; variable in &lt;STRONG&gt;GlobalParameters&lt;/STRONG&gt; equation.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=DengXian&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Synchronization and Beam Measurement&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;NR_DL_FrameSync&lt;/STRONG&gt; model is used for timing and frequency synchronization. After the synchronization is finished, this model will also measure the power of each SS/PBCH block. From this model, the following results are output:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Measured power for each SS/PBCH block (see &lt;STRONG&gt;SS/PBCH_Power&lt;/STRONG&gt; Graph)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;Synchronization information (see &lt;STRONG&gt;SyncInfo&lt;/STRONG&gt; Table)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo4&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;3.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;The measured the angles with maximum power in Tx/Rx beams (see &lt;STRONG&gt;MaxTxRxBeam&lt;/STRONG&gt; Table). Note CalMaxTxRxBeam equation is used to calculate these angles from measure SS/PBCH power.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Note that &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;1.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;STRONG&gt; &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;NR_DL_FrameSync&lt;/STRONG&gt; will introduce one SS/PBCH&amp;nbsp;periodicity delay.&amp;nbsp;The SS/PBCH&amp;nbsp;periodicity is defined by &lt;STRONG&gt;SSB_Periodicity&lt;/STRONG&gt; parameter.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-fareast-font-family: DengXian; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: DengXian; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;2.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=DengXian&gt;For FR2 SS/PBCH blocks, the SSB index(0~63) is denoted by 6 bits. The&amp;nbsp;three least significant bits are&amp;nbsp;indicated by the&amp;nbsp;DMRS for PBCH. The&amp;nbsp;three most significant&amp;nbsp;bits are carried&amp;nbsp;in BCH bits. Those 6 bits are extracted from the received SSB with the maximum rho (correlation value between received&amp;nbsp;PSS and reference PSS). &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;3. SyncInfo is comprised of 3 values. The first value is the SSB index with the &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;maximum&lt;/SPAN&gt; rho; the second value is the half frame index of that SSB; the third value is RX beam index on which the peak SSB resides.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;4. Datasheet is deleted because of the size of example is too big. Please rerun analysis to get the datasheet.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
